Package: com.qingyang.shakeblocker
Name: ShakeBlocker
Version: 1.0.0
Section: Tweaks
Maintainer: QingYang <admin@qingyang.religongsi.com>
Description: Block shake/tilt-to-redirect splash ads by gating sensor APIs. Two builds share this identifier: rootful (iOS 13-14, mobilesubstrate) and rootless (iOS 15-16, ellekit). APT picks by architecture.
Depends: mobilesubstrate
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
